# Vercel Monorepo Ignore Rules
# Ignore UI, Desktop, Mobile, and Python virtual environment files

ui
ui/**
desktop
desktop/**
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**

# Python Virtual Environments & Caches
.venv
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache

# Build outputs & native projects
dist
**/dist
**/dist/**
build
**/build
**/build/**
build-output
**/build-output/**
android
**/android
**/android/**

# Version control & environment
.git
.git/**
.env*
!.env.example
